    "content": "16.4 高阶K重根"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.165,
      0.135,
      0.395,
      0.15
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "k重复数根：通解中的2k项",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "equation",
    "bbox": [
      0.165,
      0.161,
      0.784,
      0.18
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "\\[\ne ^ {\\alpha} x \\left[ \\left(A _ {1} + A _ {2} x + \\dots + A _ {k} x ^ {k - 1}\\right) \\cos \\beta x + \\left(B _ {1} + B _ {2} x + \\dots + B _ {k} x ^ {k - 1}\\right) \\sin \\beta x \\right]\n\\]"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.165,
      0.188,
      0.441,
      0.204
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "若 \\(\\lambda_{1,2} = \\alpha \\pm \\beta i, \\beta > 0\\) 为特征方程",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.165,
      0.214,
      0.562,
      0.232
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "\\( r^{n}+a_{1}r^{n-1}+\\cdots+a_{n-1}r+a_{n}=0 \\) 的k重复数根,",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.165,
      0.241,
      0.441,
      0.257
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "则对应的齐次方程通解中的 \\(2k\\) 项",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "equation",
    "bbox": [
      0.165,
      0.267,
      0.78,
      0.286
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "\\[\ne ^ {\\alpha} x \\left[ \\left(A _ {1} + A _ {2} x + \\dots + A _ {k} x ^ {k - 1}\\right) \\cos \\beta x + \\left(B _ {1} + B _ {2} x + \\dots + B _ {k} x ^ {k - 1}\\right) \\sin \\beta x \\right]\n\\]"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.165,
      0.294,
      0.668,
      0.31
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "求高阶齐次方程的通解：将 \\(n\\) 个特征根对应的项相加得到通解",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.137,
      0.32,
      0.859,
      0.363
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "求n阶常系数线性齐次微分方程 \\( y^{(n)}+a_{1}(x)y^{(n-1)}+\\cdots+a_{n-1}(x)y'+a_{n}(x)y=0 \\) 的通解：",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.165,
      0.374,
      0.818,
      0.391
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "1 写出特征方程 \\( r^n + a_1 r^{n-1} + \\cdots + a_{n-1} r + a_n = 0 \\)，求出其特征根 \\( r_i (i = 1, 2, \\dots, n) \\)",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.165,
      0.4,
      0.655,
      0.417
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "2 对每一个根，判断对应形式：单重实根 \\(r\\) ，对应一项 \\(Ce^{\\alpha}x\\)",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.165,
      0.426,
      0.589,
      0.444
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "♡k重实根r,对应k项 \\( (C_{1}+C_{2}x+\\cdots+C_{k}x^{k-1})e^{\\alpha x}; \\)",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.165,
      0.453,
      0.761,
      0.47
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "\\(\\heartsuit\\) 单重复数根 \\(r_1.2 = \\alpha \\pm \\beta i, \\beta > 0\\), 对应两项 \\(e^{\\alpha}x(C_1\\cos \\beta x + C_2\\sin \\beta x)\\);",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.137,
      0.48,
      0.857,
      0.525
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "\\( \\heartsuit k \\) 重复数根 \\( r_{1}.2=\\alpha\\pm\\beta i,\\beta>0 \\) ,对应2k项 \\( e^{\\alpha}x\\left[(A_{1}+A_{2}x+\\cdots+A_{k}x^{k-1})\\cos\\beta x+(B_{1}+B_{2}x+\\cdots+B_{k}x^{k-1})\\sin\\beta x\\right] \\) .",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "list",
    "bbox": [
