    "content": "例1.K重"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.137,
      0.573,
      0.859,
      0.616
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "已知以  \\( y=(C_{1}x+C_{2})\\cos 2x+(C_{3}x+C_{4})\\sin 2x,\\quad(C_{1},C_{2},C_{3},C_{4} \\)  为任意常数)为通解的微分方程是  \\( y'''+ay'''+by''+cy'+dy=0 \\)  ,求  \\( a+b+c+d \\) .",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.165,
      0.639,
      0.731,
      0.656
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "3 将 \\(n\\) 个根对应的所有项相加便得通解，其中 \\(C, C_i, A_i, B_i\\) 为任意常数。",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
